'''Frostfire Knucklechains''' are a version of [[Nord Knucklechains]] upgraded with [[Frostfire Essence]]. They lose a small amount of [[Blunt|blunt damage]] in exchange for a larger amount of [[fire]] and [[Frost|frost damage]].

* The primary attack is a 2-hit combo with 2x damage at the second hit.
* The secondary attack is a kick which does additional knockback and 6x [[staggering]].
* They deal 6x damage against [[Creature senses|unalerted]] enemies.

Upgraded Nord Knucklechains will '''NOT''' keep their upgrade level when they are crafted into Frostfire Knucklechains.

